  "ingredients": [
    "4 (8 ounce) skin-on, bone-in chicken thighs",
    "1 teaspoon paprika",
    "salt and pepper to taste",
    "4 slices bacon, cut into 1/2 inch pieces",
    "0.33333334326744 cup low-sodium chicken broth",
    "4 ounces sliced mushrooms",
    "0.25 cup heavy whipping cream",
    "2 green onions, white and green parts separated and sliced"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WxSNkZe0TFAg_hEVSgr7GqLV7B0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-272437-keto-smothered-chicken-thighs-DDMFS-Step-1-f9c736ea3132469b8ad7ac7278f80254.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/272437/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season chicken thighs on all sides with paprika, salt, and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3eQqxvz9reiTeffmhoB40LLP-SU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-272437-keto-smothered-chicken-thighs-DDMFS-Step-2-05dcc77426ef42c5aaf1e783a63409b3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/272437/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook bacon in a cast iron skillet or oven-safe pan over medium-high heat until browned, 4 to 5 minutes. Remove from skillet and drain on a paper towel-lined plate. Drain and discard excess grease from the skillet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hQ69MZtHrWPpIClRSqlK9zh3YYM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-272437-keto-smothered-chicken-thighs-DDMFS-Step-3-98a3f83e51614a21b7c11fcf3c3c9e94.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/272437/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Return the skillet to medium heat and cook chicken thighs, skin-side down, for 3 to 4 minutes. Flip chicken over and place the skillet in the preheated oven.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/oE-NBs8IeIMWgjhmItFt_GMDWpE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-272437-keto-smothered-chicken-thighs-DDMFS-Step-4-eec78dfd360d486b80b598e8132775ce.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/272437/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake until chicken thighs are no longer pink at the bone and juices run clear, about 30 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted near the bone should read 165 degrees F (74 degrees C). Remove chicken to a plate and cover with foil to keep warm. Remove all but 2 tablespoons of drippings from the skillet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TUWFgx9dwfiFoWbTwfO4aGQWYOQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-272437-keto-smothered-chicken-thighs-DDMFS-Step-5-822cb557c24446e881d5925e51b3e1d3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/272437/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Return the skillet to the stove over medium-high heat. Pour in chicken broth while whisking up brown bits from the bottom of the skillet. Add mushrooms and cook until soft, about 3 to 4 minutes. Pour in heavy whipping cream and whisk together until lightly simmering, then reduce heat to medium-low. Season with salt and pepper, if necessary.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/J8T7lu08QwDeBYeEFd8Mw6ua0n0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-272437-keto-smothered-chicken-thighs-DDMFS-Step-7-4e7f39d0cc084e43b91d78225c13fa20.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/272437/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Return chicken and any juices back into the skillet; top with bacon and green onions. Serve immediately, spooning sauce over chicken.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/J7rwftRAbUTZcJPK-g5njrLz0Ok=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-272437-keto-smothered-chicken-thighs-DDMFS-Step-9-b4e19da185234524b11e1e23ecc13b8f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/272437/step_07.webp"
    }
  ],
